{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922552907/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1754063971000,"content":"<p>1.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oKqQNUDgqO8&amp;list=PLVWzia8jY3OiIRF_RwHyr4jwHEEGReLOT\" target=\"_blank\"> Eduardo Fernandez playing Bach on guitar</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/climate-environment/2025/07/30/deep-sea-discovery-pacific-ocean/\" target=\"_blank\">Lots of thriving life, 30,000 feet deep</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/UAPJames/status/1950906132383338979\" target=\"_blank\">Toward a new theory of the Senate?</a> If you do not find this puzzling, you are not paying attention.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2025/08/01/robert-wilson-playwright-director-artist-obituary?utm_source=The+Art+Newspaper+Newsletters&amp;utm_campaign=39f01ebdb5-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2025_07_25_10_18_COPY_01&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_-bd998f0c0f-62240358\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Wilson, RIP</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. I thought “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s_IEVF0GQPk\" target=\"_blank\">Oh, Hi!</a>” was a better than expected retelling of “Before Sunrise,” except the young man and woman are trapped with the mores and customs of 2025.  Ultimately a movie about just how far apart the two sexes stand today, and why the gap is unbridgeable.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/7488fe4c-5e1d-4b2b-adab-f42ad5273fc9\" target=\"_blank\">Crime vs. public disorderliness</a> (FT).</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginal